Reference data for support/verify-cxx.sh.

innd-symbols.txt   Exported symbols of innd as built by the original
                   Autoconf/Make build (nm -gU, sorted).  The CMake build
                   must export every one of these under its C name.
tinyleaf.in        NNTP session fed to tinyleaf (CRLF line endings).
tinyleaf.expected  tinyleaf's expected replies; the version line is
                   ignored when comparing.
